# Real bug found building the E10 kind smoke-test image: with no
# .dockerignore, `docker build` was uploading the live SQLite DB, the real
# vendor-corpus datasets, downloaded tool binaries, and test caches into the
# build context -- none of which belong in the image, and which (over the
# slow Windows-filesystem-to-WSL2 bridge Docker Desktop uses) turned a
# few-second context transfer into a multi-minute one. See docs/deployment.md.
data/
datasets/
bin/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
tests/
.git/
